        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "human-biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Human Biology - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Positive feedback** exists but is always self-terminating:\n- Childbirth: oxytocin → uterine contraction → more oxytocin → delivery, then placenta delivers and loop breaks\n- Blood clotting: platelet activation cascades → clot seals wound, then inhibitors (antithrombin, protein C) terminate\n- Action potential: Na⁺ influx → depolarization → more Na⁺ influx → peak, then inactivation gates close"
    },
