        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Human Biology - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nTOTAL BODY WATER ~42 L\n  INTRACELLULAR FLUID (ICF) ~28 L (67%)\n    Dominant ions: K+, Mg2+, HPO4(2-), proteins\n    Low: Na+, Cl-, Ca2+"
    },
