      "text": "The ICF/ECF gradient is maintained by **Na⁺/K⁺-ATPase** in every cell membrane:\n- Pumps 3 Na⁺ out, 2 K⁺ in per ATP — electrogenic, slightly hyperpolarizing\n- Creates the concentration gradients that power action potentials and secondary active transport\n- Consumes ~20–40% of resting metabolic ATP"
